# Rust sources are read *as text by the test suite* — several tests pin a
# property by scanning this crate's own source (the placement law, the accent
# discipline, "the pull sends no command"). A CRLF checkout breaks their line
# matching on Windows, so line endings are not a local preference here.
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
